        "id": "42901a99c19b46624aaa0625bfea509fa0482732",
        "message": "Gate scalping entries on validated action economics\n\nReconstruct the September 11 paper cycles, separate realized and modeled costs, and add causal markouts, MFE/MAE, failure attribution, and t0-t8 latency telemetry. Score passive, aggressive, and no-trade actions with chronological validation and revalidate the original decision immediately before submission. The actual historical evidence freezes a no-support model, so the new policy fails closed instead of falling back to heuristic entries.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>",
